<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-WSC Australia Cotton Weather.</title>
<headline>RTRS-WSC Australia Cotton Weather.</headline>
<text>
<p>As of 06:29 GMT, 30 OCT 1996</p>
<p>SUMMARY- Dry. Highs 70-82F (21-27C).</p>
<p>CROP IMPACT- A brief period of showers will not cause any major problems.</p>
<p>FORECAST-</p>
<p>TODAY...Partly to variably cloudy with widely scattered to scattered light showers. Highs 72-82F (22-28C).</p>
<p>TONIGHT...Variable clouds. Lows 50-65F (10-18C).</p>
<p>TOMORROW...Variable clouds with scattered showers of 0.10-0.40 inch (2-9mm). Highs 70-80F (21-26C).</p>
<p>OUTLOOK...Mostly fair and warmer Friday-Sunday. Chance of scattered showers developing on Sunday.</p>
<p>Source: Weather Services Corporation</p>
</text>
